---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Communication & Respect - Omagh Harriers AC"
    description="Respectful Communication Policy for Omagh Harriers Athletic Club"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black to-gray-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
            href="/policies"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-amber hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors mb-4"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Policies
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Communication & Respect</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
        Respectful Communication Policy (December 2024)
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- Introduction -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Respectful Communication Policy</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Purpose -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Purpose</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><br/>This policy outlines the standards of respectful communication for all members
            of Omagh Harriers Athletic Club (the &ldquo;Club&rdquo;).<br/>It applies to face-to-face interactions,
            electronic communications (email, messaging platforms, and forums), and social media usage.<br/>By adhering
            to this policy, we aim to foster a positive, inclusive, and respectful environment for all members.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Scope -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Scope</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">This policy applies to all Club members, volunteers, and associates when engaging in
            any form of communication connected to the Club&rsquo;s activities.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Policy Statements -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Policy Statements</h3>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">1. Respectful Interaction</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>All communications should be conducted with courtesy, respect, and professionalism.</li>
              <li>Avoid language or behaviours that could be perceived as offensive, discriminatory, or harassing,
                including but not limited to comments related to race, gender, age, religion, disability, or sexual
                orientation.
              </li>
              <li>Avoid Passive-Aggressive Language: Members are expected to communicate directly and constructively,
                without resorting to indirect, passive-aggressive behaviours (e.g., backhanded compliments, sarcasm, or
                veiled criticism). Such communication undermines trust and can create a hostile environment.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">2. Face-to-Face Communications</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Engage in active listening, allowing others to speak without interruption.</li>
              <li>Use constructive language, even in moments of disagreement or conflict.</li>
              <li>Avoid passive-aggressive behaviours such as eye-rolling, dismissive gestures, or indirect remarks.
              </li>
              <li>Resolve disputes privately and respectfully, seeking assistance from Club leaders if necessary.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">3. Electronic Communications</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Keep messages clear, respectful, and relevant.</li>
              <li>Avoid sharing confidential or sensitive information unless authorized.</li>
              <li>Do not use aggressive, sarcastic, or inflammatory language.</li>
              <li>Be mindful of tone and phrasing to avoid the perception of passive-aggressive intent in written
                communications.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">4. Social Media Usage</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>Represent the Club positively in all posts, comments, and shared content.</li>
              <li>Avoid posting or sharing content that is harmful, offensive, or could bring the Club into disrepute.
              </li>
              <li>Clearly distinguish personal opinions from those of the Club when posting on personal accounts.</li>
              <li>Respect the privacy of other members by not sharing photos, videos, or information without their
                consent.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">5. Zero Tolerance for Harassment or Bullying</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
              <li>The Club will not tolerate any form of harassment, bullying, or intimidation in any form of
                communication, including passive-aggressive behavior. Breaches will be dealt with promptly and may
                result in disciplinary action.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reporting and Enforcement -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Reporting and Enforcement</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><br/>Members who experience or witness breaches of this policy should report concerns
            to the Club&rsquo;s Committee or designated safeguarding officer.<br/>All reports will be handled
            confidentially and in accordance with the Club&rsquo;s disciplinary procedures.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Acknowledgment -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 text-gray-900">Acknowledgment</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><br/>By participating in Omagh Harriers A.C., members agree to abide by this
            Respectful Communication Policy.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">Non-compliance may result in warnings, suspension, or termination of membership.<br/><br/><strong>Approved
            by</strong>: Omagh Harriers A.C. Committee<br/><strong>Date</strong>: December 2024</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
          <figure><img
              src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png?w=408"
              sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px"
              srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png 408w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png?w=150 150w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png?w=300 300w"
              alt="" width="408" height="160" data-attachment-id="104"
              data-permalink="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/communication-respect/omagh-harriers_black-12/"
              data-orig-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png"
              data-orig-size="408,160" data-comments-opened="0"
              data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}"
              data-image-title="Omagh Harriers_black" data-image-description="" data-image-caption=""
              data-medium-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png?w=300"
              data-large-file="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-2.png?w=408"/>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
